WEBVTT

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.611
We want to want sex.

00:00:31.611 --> 00:00:33.029
We just don't want it.

00:00:34.614 --> 00:00:36.574
In my work with couples,

00:00:36.574 --> 00:00:39.077
one of the biggest problems I see

00:00:39.118 --> 00:00:44.123
is that sex often stalls out
before it even gets started.

00:00:44.165 --> 00:00:46.000
There’s a “failure to launch,”

00:00:46.042 --> 00:00:49.462
an inability to get going
and gain momentum.

00:00:49.504 --> 00:00:53.049
For example, one of my patients shuts down

00:00:53.091 --> 00:00:55.635
as soon as her partner starts to kiss her.

00:00:56.594 --> 00:00:59.639
Turns out, her boyfriend
in the eighth grade

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:01.557
told her she had bad breath.